    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Zhu Ba curls his whole body into an enormous meatball and rolls at Fang Yuan. Pale black blade aura wraps the ball; the crushing roll fuses with that sharp aura, splitting stone slabs and throwing stone fragments. Spectators shout the killing move name as rolling blade meat. As rolling speed rises, striking force also grows stronger.",
        "chapters": [
          300
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Zhu Ba takes the meatball form after Fang Yuan goads him into attacking. Fang Yuan later circles the meatball and hits different areas until Zhu Ba can no longer return counter-shock, then Zhu Ba cancels the meatball form and returns to human shape.",
        "chapters": [
          300
